1
00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:05,160
I was already 30 minutes in here and I had only looked through two sections, so this is why I stay for so long.
我已经在这里逛了半小时，却只看了两个区，难怪每次都待这么久。

2
00:00:05,160 --> 00:00:10,040
There's so much to look through. I went to the sweaters next and I found this slouchy oversized sweater.
要看的实在太多了。接着去毛衣区，找到这件宽松的大毛衣。

3
00:00:10,040 --> 00:00:15,120
Honestly it looks kind of plain, but trust me, these look so good on. Like I love the oversized fit.
老实说，挂着看有点普通，但穿上很好看，我喜欢这种宽松版型。

4
00:00:15,120 --> 00:00:18,480
Okay, this is the girl that was in the coats aisle with me, and she had so many cute coats in her cart.
这位就是刚才也在外套过道的女生，她车里有好多漂亮外套。

5
00:00:18,480 --> 00:00:22,070
But then she put them back and I was able to get them, and oh my God I was so happy.
后来她放回去了，我就能拿来看看，真开心。

6
00:00:22,080 --> 00:00:26,520
Anyways, after I ran for her go backs, I went back to the sweater section and I spotted this one.
总之，看过她放回的衣服后，我又回毛衣区发现了这一件。

7
00:00:26,520 --> 00:00:31,600
I liked the color and the crochet at the top, but it was inside out, so I couldn't really tell at first.
我喜欢它的颜色和上面的钩织花纹，但当时衣服翻面了，一开始看不太清。

8
00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:35,600
But then I put it right side out and it was a cute baby doll style cardigan.
翻回正面后，原来是件可爱的娃娃衫式开衫。

9
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:38,600
I was so unsure about it a little bit, but I kept it cuz I saw a vision.
我还是有点犹豫，但脑中已经想到搭配效果，就先留下了。

10
00:00:38,600 --> 00:00:42,080
Also I say to look through every item on the rack, but only for the colors that you want.
我说逐件看，也可以先只翻自己想要的颜色。

11
00:00:42,080 --> 00:00:46,760
Like I always like the neutrals, but I avoid the bright colors like these because that's not really my style.
比如我喜欢中性色，会避开这些亮色，因为不太符合我的风格。

12
00:00:46,760 --> 00:00:51,200
Time for a little snack break though, because I was an hour in at this point and I was getting a little bit hungry.
不过该休息吃点东西了，已经逛了一小时，也有点饿了。

13
00:00:51,200 --> 00:00:53,880
But this is what the cart was looking like. I was so happy with it.
购物车已经装成这样了，我很满意。

14
00:00:53,880 --> 00:01:01,319
I literally had such a huge pile and I had only gone through the sweaters and the coats and the purses, so it was such a good day today.
光看毛衣、外套和包，就已经找到一大堆，今天收获真不错。

15
00:01:01,319 --> 00:01:06,840
I would have kept going, but I only brought 200 in cash and I already had a lot, so I decided to move on to try ons.
本来还想继续，但只带了两百现金，东西也很多，就决定转去试穿。

16
00:01:06,840 --> 00:01:12,200
This is when the Octobuddy comes in handy because I can stick my phone to the mirror and film while using the mirror at the same time.
这时手机吸盘就派上用场了，可以把手机固定在镜子上，一边照镜子一边拍。

17
00:01:12,200 --> 00:01:16,400
First we have this denim jacket. Yeah, I love the sweater sleeves and collar, so this is definitely a thrift.
先看这件牛仔外套，我喜欢它的针织袖子和领子，决定拿下。

18
00:01:16,400 --> 00:01:21,319
Here's a beautiful faux fur cheetah print coat that I found earlier. I love it so much, definitely a thrift.
这是前面找到的人造毛绒猎豹纹外套，我很喜欢，想买。

19
00:01:21,319 --> 00:01:24,560
Yeah, I knew this coat was something else. Honestly one of my top finds of all time.
这件确实不一般，算得上我一直以来最喜欢的收获之一。

20
00:01:24,560 --> 00:01:29,160
Try ons aren't really necessary for the coats. I know I'm going to get them, but I honestly just have so much fun doing them.
这些外套其实不用试也知道会买，但我就是觉得试穿很好玩。

21
00:01:29,160 --> 00:01:35,400
This is my first YouTube video and I'm not really used to making long form content, so I definitely need to get better at filming literally everything.
这是我第一支 YouTube 视频，还不太习惯长视频，得更善于把过程都拍下来。

22
00:01:35,400 --> 00:01:42,000
But here's some of the other coats and jackets that I found. This is one of the ones from the other girl's cart. Again I'm so happy that she put it back.
再看看其他外套，这件也是另一位女生放回来的，很高兴能遇上它。

23
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:46,840
Summer is definitely the best time to shop for coats and jackets like these, and it just makes me so, so excited for fall.
对我来说，夏天淘这类外套很合适，也让我更期待秋天。

24
00:01:46,840 --> 00:01:52,120
Like I'm going to have such a good wardrobe now, and you guys too of course because I list a lot of these to my Depop.
这样衣橱就丰富了；我也会把很多衣服挂到 Depop 上，让大家挑。

25
00:01:52,120 --> 00:01:57,400
I really like this leather jacket, but after I realized that it had a hole in it and so I had to leave it.
我很喜欢这件皮夹克，但后来发现破了一个洞，只好放弃。

26
00:01:57,400 --> 00:02:02,840
This is the biker one that I showed earlier, and yeah I didn't really like the fit. The scrunch was a little off for me.
这是前面那件机车款，我不太喜欢上身版型，收褶的位置也不太合适。

27
00:02:02,840 --> 00:02:05,920
But these next two were so good, so they definitely made up for it.
不过接下来两件很好看，足够弥补刚才的小失望。

28
00:02:05,920 --> 00:02:12,880
This one I actually didn't get, but I posted it in a YouTube short and someone commented that it looked like one of Belle's outfits, so I actually went back and got it another day.
这件本来没买，后来有人在短视频下说像贝儿的衣服，我又改天回去买了。

29
00:02:12,880 --> 00:02:18,640
Then my bracelet broke in the middle of try on. So sad because I got this at a flea market in Italy, but it's okay.
试穿到一半手链断了，有点难过，因为是在意大利跳蚤市场买的，不过也没关系。

30
00:02:18,640 --> 00:02:21,880
I like the material of this, but not the weird shoulder situation going on.
我喜欢这件的材质，不过肩部效果不太理想。

31
00:02:21,880 --> 00:02:27,520
Okay, this sweater, bear with me. It looks a little funny right now, but I actually love styling these ones. Let me show you.
这件毛衣先别急，挂着看有点怪，但我很喜欢搭它，给你看看。

32
00:02:27,520 --> 00:02:33,440
First I unbutton the little collar and then just pull it off the shoulder from the sides and the back, and then it'll look like this.
先解开领口，再从两侧和背后往下拉成露肩，效果就是这样。

33
00:02:33,440 --> 00:02:38,070
And I think it's so cute this way. And I did the same thing for this sweater too, and it looks so good.
我觉得这样很可爱，另一件毛衣也同样处理，效果很好。

34
00:02:38,080 --> 00:02:41,280
Here's that baby doll cardigan from earlier. It's a little big, but I actually love it so much.
这是前面那件娃娃衫式开衫，稍微大一点，但我很喜欢。

35
00:02:41,280 --> 00:02:45,190
And a baby doll styled top, these are always my favorite to find. They're just so cute.
还有娃娃衫式上衣，这类一直是我最喜欢淘的，太可爱了。

36
00:02:45,200 --> 00:02:48,030
Oh, here's a cheetah print bag. Yeah, I love it a lot, definitely getting her.
这是那个猎豹纹包，我很喜欢，肯定要买。

37
00:02:48,040 --> 00:02:53,600
This is the Rory Gilmore sweater, so perfect for fall. I love pairing a V neck like this with a little lace cami underneath.
这件很有 Rory Gilmore 的毛衣风格，适合秋天；我喜欢在 V 领里面搭蕾丝小吊带。

38
00:02:53,600 --> 00:02:59,480
This one's a little zip up, giving downtown girl vibes. Yeah, just so many sweaters and cardigans, I love all of these so much.
这件是拉链款，很有都市女孩的感觉。今天好多毛衣和开衫，我都很喜欢。

39
00:02:59,480 --> 00:03:07,680
Also I swear try ons are so important because they don't always look good on the hanger, but putting them on gives it a little shape and curve, which can make all the difference.
试穿真的很重要，衣服挂着不总好看，上身后有了轮廓和曲线，效果可能完全不同。

40
00:03:07,680 --> 00:03:14,400
Anyways, again this is my first YouTube video, so I'm sorry that it's kind of short. I really need to get better at filming longer content.
总之，这是我的第一支 YouTube 视频，可能有点短，还得练习拍更长的内容。

41
00:03:14,400 --> 00:03:22,880
But I hope you like this haul and this little thrift with me. If you want to see more, I can definitely continue making these to help give you a better insight of what my thrift process is like.
希望你喜欢这次购物分享和逛店过程；如果想看，我可以继续拍，让大家更了解我的挑选流程。

42
00:03:22,880 --> 00:03:28,040
But wrapping this up, I spent a total of 170 for 30 items and I was here for 3 hours.
最后总结一下，买了三十件，总共花了一百七十，逛了三个小时。

43
00:03:28,040 --> 00:03:32,319
But if you made it through, thank you guys so much for watching.
如果你看到了这里，非常感谢观看。
